  "source_scope_disclosure": "Literal547 summation-placement intermediate remains unchanged with the full strict-p claim540–541, exact p-vector formulas519–524, nonzero decomposition532–538 and full546–549 chain. No replacement derivation supplied. Primary scope is closed DUY pullback embedding and reduced fixed-component statement only; later Fano/positive-component proofs are unselected. Parent bounded staging decision for literal547 pending.",
  "difficulty_level": "H3",
  "draft_difficulty_reason": "Properness and injectivity of pullback do not by themselves give a closed embedding at the singular Donaldson–Uhlenbeck–Yau strata. The authors construct a new explicit ramified matrix lift, prove invariant-ring surjectivity from the complete lifted trace/scalar-product generators, and control the resulting fixed analytic germs and normality. Their full local moduli/formality/quiver analysis then supports the normality-and-Zariski-Main closing step, rather than leaving the singular-stratum obligation as background.",
